  <!-- Synthetic stress fixture, generated. ~2000 elements, depth 8.
     ECS-PLAN.md §4.3 reasons about a 2000-element document and the
     rest of the corpus tops out at 125, so every figure in E0-E4 was
     taken two orders of magnitude below the design target. This is
     AOSOA-SPEC.md G0: the fixture that says whether those numbers
     survive at scale.

     Deterministic by construction - no RNG, no clock, no timestamp -
     so it can carry a golden like any other corpus document.

     Prose is a cycled word pool, not lorem ipsum: line breaking needs
     varied word lengths and the E4.6 shape cache needs runs that
     mostly do NOT repeat, or it would report a hit rate no real
     document could reach.

     Regenerate: docs/tools/gen-synthetic.py -->
